Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 16:16:18 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 08/16] autobench: the launch records cli {version, sha256,
 pinned}; resume on other CLI bytes is refused (C2)

harness/foundry.mjs cliIdentity(): the pinned CLI (FOUNDRY_CLI_LOCK) or the one on PATH,
hashed. run.mjs stores it in launch.json, keeps it out of the settings comparison and
refuses a resume whose CLI bytes differ (cliPinChange); a launch that predates the field
continues and records the CLI it resumed with. The step guard targets the pinned path,
which is kept read-only in the sandbox. The manifest keeps the version string.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_011geBy7JvDqKuqhDyfmzd1U
